# CLAUDE.md

Per-repo orientation for `${project_org}/${project_name}`.

## What this is

`${project_name}` ${project_description}:

- Lives on ${git_host} (`${git_host}/${project_org}/${project_name}`);

## Layout

```
mise.toml               # pinned go + golangci-lint + goreleaser + universal tools
justfile                # `just` task runner — `just` for the menu
.forgejo/workflows/     # CI (Forgejo Actions) — primary
.github/workflows/      # CI (GitHub Actions) — mirror
```

## Workflows

### Lint + format

- `just lint` —  + yamllint + markdownlint + prettier
- `just fmt` —  + yamlfmt + prettier `--write`.

## Renovate

- `mise.toml` versions are handled by a custom regex manager configured
  upstream in `${project_org}/renovate-config`.
